From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Fluorite Integration Role
Date: Mon, 20 Jul 2026 22:45:00 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] filament_scene: omit startup shapes for payload isolation probe

Temporarily remove startup shapes to distinguish a scene-level crash from a
shape serialization/type contract crash. This is an isolation probe, not the
target demo configuration.
---
 packages/filament_scene/example/lib/shape_and_object_creators.dart | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/packages/filament_scene/example/lib/shape_and_object_creators.dart b/packages/filament_scene/example/lib/shape_and_object_creators.dart
@@ -19,1 +19,1 @@
-  return itemsToReturn.isEmpty ? <Shape>[] : <Shape>[itemsToReturn.first];
+  return <Shape>[];

-- 
2.34.1
